BWH Hotels owns three brands, WorldHotels, Best Western Hotels & Resorts and Sure Hotels, and the exposed fields are contact and reservation data, not passport data. The access ran from 2025-10-14 until discovery on 2026-04-22 according to the guest emails SecurityWeek quotes, while The Register says the affected data goes back to that date; no source discloses the access vector, the number or location of affected guests, or an infostealer or contractor-account route.
